# museglimmer-30b-iq8r.recipe -- Meta Muse Glimmer 30B from the bf16 release with an IQ8R trunk and
# an int8 head, served by arch/museglimmer_ct.
#
#   rad-convert <Muse-Glimmer-30B> --recipe data/recipes/museglimmer-30b-iq8r.recipe \
#       --set quantization_config.quant_method=compressed-tensors -o muse-glimmer-30b-iq8r.rad
#
# The --set selects the plugin registered at ("museglimmer", "compressed-tensors"), which reads the
# trunk's form from layer 0's q projection; no other descriptor key is read.
#
#   - IQ8R: every trunk linear (attention q, gate, k, v and output; the feed-forward's gate/up and
#     down) as int8 codes in -127..127 with one u8 scale per (row, 256 of K) under one bf16 scale a
#     row, each 128 of K rotated by the unnormalised Hadamard before rounding and the 1/128 kept in
#     the row scale (`transform=fwht128`). Round to nearest with a scale search; no calibration
#     data is read. The plugin serves them at gemm_nt_q i8a8h against int8 activations under the
#     same rotation, written by the two pre-norms (q, gate, k, v and gate/up), the gated product
#     (down) and the out projection's own quantiser (o). An IQ8R container is IQ8R in all seven.
#     The rules are the ones the other IQ8R recipes give their trunks (arch/qwen35_w8a8,
#     arch/llama_dense_fp8, arch/flint).
#   - The lm_head as int8 unrotated with a bf16 scale per (row, 128) (logits_gemm_i8), which the
#     DFlash drafter, when the container carries one, reads as its head too.
#   - The norms, the embedding, the vision tower and its adapter match no rule and stay bf16, and
#     so do a merged drafter's own matrices (`dspark.*`; the trunk patterns do not reach them).
#
# About 30.8 GiB by the tensor shapes: 23.5 GiB of IQ8R trunk, 1.3 GiB of int8 head, 2.5 GiB of
# bf16 embedding, 3.4 GiB of bf16 vision tower.

blk.*.attn_q.weight                  rtn  codes=i8 group=256 scale=u8 scale2=bf16 block2=1x* transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
blk.*.attn_gate.weight               rtn  codes=i8 group=256 scale=u8 scale2=bf16 block2=1x* transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
blk.*.attn_k.weight                  rtn  codes=i8 group=256 scale=u8 scale2=bf16 block2=1x* transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
blk.*.attn_v.weight                  rtn  codes=i8 group=256 scale=u8 scale2=bf16 block2=1x* transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
blk.*.attn_output.weight             rtn  codes=i8 group=256 scale=u8 scale2=bf16 block2=1x* transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
blk.*.ffn_gate_up.weight             rtn  codes=i8 group=256 scale=u8 scale2=bf16 block2=1x* transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
blk.*.ffn_down.weight                rtn  codes=i8 group=256 scale=u8 scale2=bf16 block2=1x* transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search

output.weight                        rtn  codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 clamp=sym rule=search
